  "problem": "A bird sanctuary initially has $80$ birds. The number of birds in the sanctuary $B(t)$ increases at a rate that obeys an inhibited growth model, where $t\\ge 0$ is the time in months. If the maximum capacity of the sanctuary is $110$ birds, which differential equation could be used to model the bird population? Assume that $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality.",
